<title>ISRAEL: Israel Corp extends offer for Piryon.</title>
<headline>Israel Corp extends offer for Piryon.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Israel Corp said it has extended its offer for the purchase of all outstanding shares of the Piryon Investment Co.</p>
<p>The original offer of 95 shekels per share was made on August 11.</p>
<p>The Israel Corp now holds 90 percent of Piryon shares following the initial tender. The extension of the offer is through September 30 and is at the same price.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Israel Corp confirmed the company would like to obtain as close to 100 perent of all Piryon shares in order to delist the share from the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.17 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
